The initial stage manifest and record are preserved as initial-manifest.json and initial-record.md (manifest SHA 98518069c33edc35c9c598bd6767aa258cb9c39bd6cd24db9095cee4cf09b60f). The previously unexecuted restoration stage has now completed.

